[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
==========================================================================
eloipool has been installed.

FIRST-TIME SETUP:
  1. Copy and edit the config file:
       cp %%PREFIX%%/etc/eloipool/config.py.sample \
          %%PREFIX%%/etc/eloipool/config.py
       edit %%PREFIX%%/etc/eloipool/config.py

  2. Key config options to set:
       TrackerAddr   - Your Bitcoin payout address
       UpstreamBitcoind - RPC connection to bitcoind
       JSONRPCAddresses / StratumAddresses - Listening ports

  3. For merged mining (e.g. Namecoin), configure:
       AuxPow servers via the setworkaux RPC interface

ENABLING THE SERVICE:
  Add to /etc/rc.conf:
    eloipool_enable="YES"

  Then:
    service eloipool start

PYTHON VERSION NOTE:
  eloipool requires Python 3.6-3.11 and is NOT compatible with
  Python 3.12+ (asynchat was removed). Ensure the correct version
  is active if multiple Python versions are installed.

Files:
  Config sample : %%PREFIX%%/etc/eloipool/config.py.sample
  Application   : %%PREFIX%%/share/eloipool/
  Wrapper script: %%PREFIX%%/bin/eloipool
==========================================================================
EOM
}
]
